# C++-level GC coordination self-test (SimpleMarkSweepGC::
# runCoordinationSelfTest): hammers RT yield sections vs requestCollect
# (incl. the deferred-wake path), persistent + nested ExternalParticipants,
# GCSafeBlockScope, interned-string churn, precise typed-root liveness, and
# concurrent root construction/destruction, then asserts collections ran with
# zero section-collector violations and all counters returned to rest.  The
# verdict prints on stdout; the counter summary prints on stderr and is
# shape-checked by gc_selftest.err.
_runtests('gc_coordination')
